      "id": "update-source-from-function",
      "name": "UpdateSourceFromFunction",
      "category": "VolumeTexture",
      "signature": "UpdateSourceFromFunction(Target, Func, Size X, Size Y, Size Z, Format)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UVolumeTexture*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Func",
          "type": "TFunction<void ( int32,int32,int32,void* )>"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size X",
          "type": "Int"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size Y",
          "type": "Int"
        },
        {
          "name": "Size Z",
          "type": "Int"
        },
        {
          "name": "Format",
          "type": "ETextureSourceFormat"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Updates a volume texture from a user function, which allows for arbitrary UVolumeTexture objects to be filled.\nThe pointer passed to the user function is owned by UVolumeTexture and should be cast to the required type\nbefore being filled up with the new voxel data.\n@param\tFunc\tA function taking the x, y, z position as input and returning the texture data for this position.\n@param\tSizeX\tThe width of the volume texture.\n@param\tSizeY\tThe height of the volume texture.\n@param\tSizeZ\tThe depth of the volume texture.\n@param\tFormat\tThe input volume texture format."
    },
